HMFAN

This repository contains modifications and research code built on BasicSR:
https://github.com/XPixelGroup/BasicSR

BasicSR is distributed under the Apache License 2.0. Third-party components
and dependencies, including NATTEN and code adapted from other open-source
projects, remain subject to their respective licenses and attribution terms.

The HMFAN-specific modifications include hierarchical memory fusion,
RangeGate, selective Fourier-domain modulation, experiment configurations,
evaluation utilities, and released pretrained models.
